														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4508160">
									

<p>I never LOVED lists of mass production stuff being SCPs, but the sheer irregularity (in the sense of lack of consistent categorization/regulation at the time) of pre-Crash videogames is absolutely ripe for weirdness and it's a Very Roget Sort Of Inspiration.</p>
<p>The effect of this SCP is really really bizarre. It has nothing to do with the game itself, it's a classic effect on a classic item - something esoteric (in this case, old technology) with a Bad Stuff Happens effect (destruction of hearing and followup with destruction of part of the brain). I don't love the flag, like T Rutherford above said. Feels kind of weak and tacked on, and made me kind of squint. Doesn't connect to the rest of the leadup.</p>
<p>Beyond the list of Other Games added below I think the warning is the weakest part of the SCP. But overall? I really like it.</p>

